1
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:58,740
I don't care how much you were involved,

2
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,730
or what your relationship with that woman is.

3
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,580
I will forgive your rebellion this time.

4
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,140
Father.

5
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:19,539
Thank you for your forgiveness.

6
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:21,740
Thank you

7
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,860
for always thinking of me.

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,940
You really are a good father.

9
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,520
So,

10
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:05,480
you did all this.

11
00:02:30,540 --> 00:02:32,180
December 1st.

12
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,200
Yesterday.

13
00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:39,079
It was Chenyao.

14
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,540
This...

15
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:42,480
This...

16
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:49,140
Chenyao.

17
00:03:26,740 --> 00:03:27,480
What?

18
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,380
You said the things you forced me to do in the past

19
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:33,340
were instigated by your father.

20
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:47,880
Qianqian.

21
00:03:49,140 --> 00:03:50,800
How long have you been with me?

22
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:53,280
Two years.

23
00:03:55,940 --> 00:03:56,840
Two years.

24
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,530
You've become the most trusted person by my side.

25
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,800
It's all because Mr. Ling

26
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:07,930
intentionally cultivated me.

27
00:04:10,940 --> 00:04:12,080
We are the same.

28
00:04:13,540 --> 00:04:15,800
We stop at nothing to achieve our goals.

29
00:04:20,579 --> 00:04:22,420
You don't hesitate to use your own sister

30
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:23,540
as a tool.

31
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:29,170
You've secretly made off with a lot of clients' money, haven't you?

32
00:04:33,140 --> 00:04:33,670
Mr. Ling.

33
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:34,280
I...

34
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,320
I know why you did this.

35
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:51,100
Mucheng's position back then

36
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,980
should have belonged to your sister.

37
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,810
Do something for me.

38
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:04,440
I will make your sister the top star,

39
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:09,370
and give you half of the company's shares.

40
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,820
Don't move.

41
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,410
Why are you here?

42
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:30,200
How about

43
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,480
we try again?

44
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:33,380
Actually,

45
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,900
things might still turn around.

46
00:05:37,740 --> 00:05:39,800
I don't know what you're trying to do.

47
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:42,280
Stop right there.

48
00:05:44,180 --> 00:05:46,180
All the cases you're involved in,

49
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:48,470
I'll take the blame for you.

50
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:51,920
Also,

51
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,440
that media company,

52
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:57,240
I'll give you all the shares.

53
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,930
I just need you to get the notebook back for me.

54
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:14,980
Dear Father,

55
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:20,340
I don't understand what you're saying.

56
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,610
Just serve your sentence in peace,

57
00:06:25,140 --> 00:06:26,740
confess your crimes,

58
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,400
and truly repent.

59
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:33,200
I will definitely take good care of the company for you.

60
00:06:34,140 --> 00:06:35,780
Not just that media company,

61
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:38,540
but the entire group.

62
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:40,710
I'll take good care of all of it.

63
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,180
By the way,

64
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,940
don't forget,

65
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,400
I

66
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:53,280
am your biological son.

67
00:07:10,580 --> 00:07:11,540
And,

68
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,380
I will also definitely

69
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:17,340
take good care of my own brother.

70
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:01,840
Congratulations.

71
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,240
All of this is finally coming to an end.

72
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:22,940
What's wrong?

73
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,120
Nothing.

74
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:36,480
I just feel like ever since you appeared,

75
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,340
everything has become so dreamy.

76
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,080
Even now, I often wonder

77
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,320
if all of this

78
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:46,020
is really just a dream.

79
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,540
Thank you.

80
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,240
For what?

81
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,640
Everything.

82
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,780
Thank you, too.

83
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:01,360
For what?

84
00:09:02,280 --> 00:09:03,140
Because of you,

85
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,380
after a thousand years,

86
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:09,560
I suddenly feel alive again.

87
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,380
Really?

88
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:13,400
Of course.

89
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,720
Who taught you to be so cheesy?

90
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,340
I'm telling the truth.

91
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,420
Why do I feel

92
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,970
that since we came back,

93
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:39,790
something is weird?

94
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:40,780
What's weird?

95
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,520
Every time I get close to you, I feel

96
00:09:45,400 --> 00:09:47,060
like we're so familiar,

97
00:09:48,180 --> 00:09:50,580
like we've known each other for a long time.

98
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,960
But

99
00:09:53,160 --> 00:09:55,200
there's also a hint of...

100
00:09:57,260 --> 00:09:57,980
What?

101
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:02,780
Regret,

102
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,840
and a bit of anger.

103
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:08,140
I can't explain it.

104
00:10:17,540 --> 00:10:18,340
Chen Yao,

105
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,820
did you promise my dad

106
00:10:22,740 --> 00:10:23,900
that if one day

107
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:25,980
I can stand on my own,

108
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,980
you would leave?

109
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:32,180
Yes.

110
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:34,380
I mean,

111
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:38,140
is it possible for you not to leave?

112
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,930
Don't leave Tang'er behind, okay?

113
00:11:08,980 --> 00:11:11,880
I'm not trying to force you to stay.

114
00:11:12,540 --> 00:11:13,980
Aren't you a spirit?

115
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:16,420
To you, my life is so short.

116
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:20,000
Why don't you just be a good guy to the end

117
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,410
and stay with me for the rest of my life?

118
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,740
I'm just kidding.

119
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,740
Did you take it seriously?

120
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:52,510
Since you appeared when I was at my weakest

121
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,440
and let me rely on you,

122
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,740
the rest of my life should be the same.

123
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:01,240
Please don't go.
